# Gradle generates gradlew with LF line endings and gradlew.bat with CRLF.
# Store both exactly as generated, so the wrapper task and Dependabot's
# wrapper bumps reproduce the tracked bytes instead of rewriting every
# line. Disabling conversion also keeps each script's endings intact in
# any checkout, whatever core.autocrlf is set to: sh rejects CR, and
# cmd.exe can misparse labels in a batch file with bare LF.
/gradlew      -text
/gradlew.bat  -text
